[0.000, "o", "\r\nWHAT THE DATA ACTUALLY CONTAINED\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  correct verdict: NAME THE CAUSE\r\n  planted cause: GA4 session collection stopped after 3 August; the range runs to the 15th. PostHog kept recording throughout -- pageviews and signups both -- so traffic did not stop, the measurement did. The answer is the data incident, not a business cause.\r\n  decoys placed to mislead: deploy, campaign, seasonal\r\n  signals a correct answer names: any of [stopped, stops, stop reporting, no data after, no rows, collection, truncated, ends], any of [signup, signups, pageview, pageviews]\r\n"]
